{"id":"n63910-1-13","stage":3,"title":"손톱 · 指甲","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63910-1-13-1","ko":"그렇게 손톱이 길면 피아노 치기 힘들지 않아?","zh":"指甲留得那么长，弹钢琴不会很费力吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样，就那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样，就那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"4","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손톱이","meaning":"指甲","explanation":"손톱：指甲；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손톱","audio":"/audio/5fa639f56a908bbcc321.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63910","senseId":"1","lemma":"손톱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길면","meaning":"长","explanation":"길다：长；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"1","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피아노","meaning":"钢琴","explanation":"피아노：钢琴","readings":[{"term":"피아노","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31505","senseId":"1","lemma":"피아노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치기","meaning":"弹，弹奏，打","explanation":"치다：弹，弹奏，打；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"3","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘들지","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样，就那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"没有什么特别的变化。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"5fa639f56a908bbc","term":"손톱","zh":"指甲","audio":"/audio/5fa639f56a908bbcc321.mp3","entryId":"63910","definition":"生长在指头尖儿，硬而薄的部分。","pronunciation":["손톱"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"从物体的一端到另一端相距甚远。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]},{"id":"a42d6c6f1325fb23","term":"피아노","zh":"钢琴","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3","entryId":"31505","definition":"用手指敲击黑色及白色键盘而发出声响的大型乐器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"弹，弹奏，打","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"演奏打击乐器、键盘乐器或吉他等。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有花费很多力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc3902ebfff742053190.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63910-1-13-2","ko":"그래서 나도 지금 깎으려고.","zh":"所以我现在也打算把它剪了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깎으려고.","meaning":"剪","explanation":"깎다：剪；으려고：在句末表达打算或意图，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"2","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"18d3575b885757d9","term":"깎다","zh":"剪","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3","entryId":"57278","definition":"把草或毛等切短。","pronunciation":["깍따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9971cbbf57c020ad4830.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63910","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["所以我现在也打算把它剪了。","门好像锁上了，怎么打不开呢？","指甲留得那么长，弹钢琴不会很费力吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["所以我现在也打算把它剪了。","指甲留得那么长，弹钢琴不会很费力吗？","门好像锁上了，怎么打不开呢？"],"answer":0}]}
